#: ../../04-repo-map.md:194 7b9cba5fc23649a5885b441ce69d0481
msgid ""
"**Naming**: Core files are `switch_<area>.c` / `switch_<area>.h`. Modules "
"are `mod_<name>` under a category directory. Config files are XML named "
"`<feature>.conf.xml` under `autoload_configs/`."
msgstr ""
"**命名**：核心文件为 `switch_<area>.c` / `switch_<area>.h`。模块为分类目录下的 "
"`mod_<name>`。配置文件为 `autoload_configs/` 下名为 `<feature>.conf.xml` 的 XML。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:195 8e30815ffa964bb2a59ff91e94db81d0
msgid ""
"**Layering**: `src/switch.c` → core (`switch_core_*`, RTP, IVR, XML) → "
"loadable modules. Modules call into `src/include/`; they must not become a "
"second core. Bundled libs stay in `libs/` and are linked by the core or by "
"specific modules."
msgstr ""
"**分层**：`src/switch.c` → 核心（`switch_core_*`、RTP、IVR、XML）→ 可加载模块。模块调用 "
"`src/include/`；不得演变成第二套核心。捆绑库留在 `libs/`，由核心或特定模块链接。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:196 176fbe767ca24daa93906b65b297e068
msgid ""
"**Module boundaries**: Category folders are the ownership boundary (endpoint"
" vs application vs codec). Enable/disable is `modules.conf`, not `#ifdef` "
"sprawl in the core. Out-of-tree modules can be cloned via `modules.conf` "
"git-source lines (`src/mod/Makefile.am`)."
msgstr ""
"**模块边界**：分类目录即所有权边界（端点 vs 应用 vs 编解码器）。启用/禁用通过 `modules.conf`，而不是在核心里铺开 "
"`#ifdef`。树外模块可通过 `modules.conf` 的 git-source 行克隆（`src/mod/Makefile.am`）。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:197 dd60b301c2b247349ada599247daae9a
msgid ""
"**Config vs code**: Runtime behavior is XML under `conf/<profile>/`, not "
"compiled constants. The preprocessor (`X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include`) flattens"
" to `freeswitch.xml.fsxml` at start."
msgstr ""
"**配置 vs 代码**：运行时行为是 `conf/<profile>/` 下的 XML，而非编译期常量。预处理器（`X-PRE-PROCESS` / "
"`#include`）在启动时展平为 `freeswitch.xml.fsxml`。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:198 719f930cc4e94981afc51ccc2f15e2b4
msgid ""
"**Scripts and tooling**: packaging in `scripts/packaging/` and `debian/`; CI"
" glue in `scripts/ci/` and `.github/`; maintainer gdb in `support-d/gdb/`."
msgstr ""
"**脚本与工具**：打包在 `scripts/packaging/` 与 `debian/`；CI 粘合在 `scripts/ci/` 与 "
"`.github/`；维护者 gdb 在 `support-d/gdb/`。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:199 e55d534e87454294a67f682976a05491
msgid ""
"**Tests**: core unit tests in `tests/unit/` (libfreeswitch only). Some "
"modules carry their own `test/` trees (for example Sofia SIPp scenarios "
"under `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`)."
msgstr ""
"**测试**：核心单元测试在 `tests/unit/`（仅 libfreeswitch）。部分模块自带 `test/` 目录（例如 Sofia "
"SIPp 场景位于 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`）。"

#: ../../04-repo-map.md:200 683042a0f72546948dfcf3f2805498b9
msgid ""
"**Build systems**: Autotools is the supported Unix path. "
"`src/CMakeLists.txt` exists but is historical (CMake 2.6 comment). Windows "
"uses the `.sln` / `w32/` project files."
msgstr ""
